        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "quote",
        "text": "Many of Copley's other subjects were depicted to impress, with mannerisms, ornate clothing and an enlightened background creating the image of a modern, respectable elite.",
        "source": {
          "author": "Wikipedia contributors",
          "title": "Unfinished portrait of Nathaniel Hurd",
